<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>SCM Gathering 2026 - Synergy: Leveling Up!</title>
  <!-- Google Fonts & Font Awesome -->
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
  
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-dark: #122831;
      --card-bg: #1B3844;
      --accent-yellow: #F1B811;
      --text-light: #FFFFFF;
      --text-dim: #D1D5DB;
      --accent-green: #10B981;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg-dark);
      color: var(--text-light);
      line-height: 1.6;
      padding-bottom: 50px;
    }

    header {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 60px 20px 40px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.4) 0%, rgba(18,40,49,1) 100%);
    }

    header h2 {
      color: var(--accent-yellow);
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: 2.8rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin: 10px 0;
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .event-meta {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 15px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 15px;
    }

    .badge {
      background: rgba(241, 184, 17, 0.2);
      color: var(--accent-yellow);
      border: 1px solid var(--accent-yellow);
      padding: 6px 16px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 25px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }

    .card h3 {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      color: var(--accent-yellow);
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    /* Registration & Payment */
    .price-box {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .old-price {
      text-decoration: line-through;
      color: #9CA3AF;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .new-price {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--accent-yellow);
      margin: 5px 0;
    }

    .subsidy-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--accent-green);
      color: white;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .bank-card {
      border: 1px dashed var(--accent-yellow);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 15px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      background: rgba(241, 184, 17, 0.05);
    }

    .copy-btn {
      background: var(--accent-yellow);
      color: var(--bg-dark);
      border: none;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: 0.2s;
    }

    .copy-btn:hover {
      opacity: 0.9;
    }

    /* Rundown Tabs */
    .tab-buttons {
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .tab-btn {
      flex: 1;
      padding: 10px;
      border: none;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      color: var(--text-light);
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .tab-btn.active {
      background: var(--accent-yellow);
      color: var(--bg-dark);
    }

    .timeline {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .timeline-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 15px;
      padding: 10px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .time {
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--accent-yellow);
      min-width: 95px;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    /* Gear Grid */
    .gear-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(130px, 1fr));
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .gear-item {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      padding: 10px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    /* T&C List */
    .tc-list {
      padding-left: 20px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--text-dim);
    }

    .tc-list li {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 40px;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <h2>Synergy</h2>
    <h1>LEVELING UP!</h1>
    <p style="color: var(--text-dim);">SCM Gathering 2026</p>
    
    <div class="event-meta">
      <div class="badge"><i class="fa-regular fa-calendar"></i> 7–8 November 2026</div>
      <div class="badge"><i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot"></i> De Gemelos Villa, Sentul</div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="container">

    <!-- Special Contribution / Payment -->
    <div class="card">
      <h3><i class="fa-solid fa-ticket"></i> Kontribusi Peserta</h3>
      <div class="price-box">
        <div class="old-price">Rp 230.000</div>
        <div class="new-price">Rp 130.000 <span style="font-size:1rem; font-weight:normal;">/ orang</span></div>
        <div class="subsidy-badge">Hemat Rp 100.000 (Subsidi Uang Kas)</div>
      </div>

      <div class="bank-card">
        <div>
          <p style="font-size:0.8rem; color:#9CA3AF;">Transfer Ke:</p>
          <strong style="font-size:1.1rem; color:#FFF;">MANDIRI - 60010963076</strong>
          <p style="font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--text-dim);">a.n Milla Mariska</p>
        </div>
        <button class="copy-btn" onclick="copyRekening('60010963076')"><i class="fa-regular fa-copy"></i> Salin</button>
      </div>
      <p style="font-size:0.8rem; color:#9CA3AF; margin-top:10px; text-align:center;">
        *Pembayaran paling lambat <strong>22 Oktober 2026</strong>
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Rundown -->
    <div class="card">
      <h3><i class="fa-solid fa-clock"></i> Rundown Acara</h3>
      <div class="tab-buttons">
        <button class="tab-btn active" onclick="switchDay(1)">Day 1 (7 Nov)</button>
        <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchDay(2)">Day 2 (8 Nov)</button>
      </div>

      <!-- Day 1 -->
      <div id="day1" class="timeline">
        <div class="timeline-item"><div class="time">05.15 - 05.30</div><div>Kumpul & briefing di MBS Ged A</div></div>
        <div class="timeline-item"><div class="time">05.30 - 07.00</div><div>Berangkat menuju lokasi</div></div>
        <div class="timeline-item"><div class="time">07.00 - 08.00</div><div>Start menuju Curug Hordeng + Stretching</div></div>
        <div class="timeline-item"><div class="time">08.00 - 11.00</div><div>Start trekking Curug Hordeng & bersih-bersih</div></div>
        <div class="timeline-item"><div class="time">11.00 - 11.30</div><div>Trekking balik ke parkiran</div></div>
        <div class="timeline-item"><div class="time">11.30 - 12.30</div><div>Goes to Warung Sambal Dower for lunch</div></div>
        <div class="timeline-item"><div class="time">12.30 - 13.30</div><div>ISOMA (Lunch)</div></div>
        <div class="timeline-item"><div class="time">13.30 - 14.00</div><div>Goes to Villa</div></div>
        <div class="timeline-item"><div class="time">14.00 - 15.30</div><div>Check in & Istirahat (Free time)</div></div>
        <div class="timeline-item"><div class="time">15.30 - 17.30</div><div>Fun Game</div></div>
        <div class="timeline-item"><div class="time">17.30 - 19.00</div><div>ISOMA (Sholat Maghrib s/d Isya)</div></div>
        <div class="timeline-item"><div class="time">19.00 - 20.00</div><div>Dinner</div></div>
        <div class="timeline-item"><div class="time">20.00 - 00.00</div><div>Chill & Connect</div></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Day 2 -->
      <div id="day2" class="timeline" style="display:none;">
        <div class="timeline-item"><div class="time">06.30 - 09.00</div><div>Sarapan / Free time</div></div>
        <div class="timeline-item"><div class="time">09.00 - 10.00</div><div>Pembagian hadiah / Doorprize</div></div>
        <div class="timeline-item"><div class="time">10.00 - 11.00</div><div>Prepare pulang</div></div>
        <div class="timeline-item"><div class="time">11.00 - 12.00</div><div>Maksi duyuuu ~ ~</div></div>
        <div class="timeline-item"><div class="time">12.00 - 13.30</div><div>OTW MBS Ged A</div></div>
        <div class="timeline-item"><div class="time">13.30</div><div>Selesaaaii.. bye.. bye..</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Mandatory & Optional Gear -->
    <div class="card">
      <h3><i class="fa-solid fa-suitcase"></i> Perlengkapan (Gear List)</h3>
      <h4 style="color:var(--accent-yellow); margin-top:10px; font-size:0.95rem;">Mandatory Gear (WAJIB):</h4>
      <div class="gear-grid">
        <div class="gear-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-shirt"></i> Baju Ganti</div>
        <div class="gear-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-shoe-prints"></i> Sepatu Trekking / Sandal Gunung</div>
        <div class="gear-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-vest"></i> Jaket / Outer</div>
        <div class="gear-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-pills"></i> Obat Pribadi</div>
        <div class="gear-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-bottle-water"></i> Botol Minum</div>
        <div class="gear-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-soap"></i> Perlengkapan Mandi</div>
        <div class="gear-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-socks"></i> Kaos Kaki Cadangan</div>
        <div class="gear-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-mobile-screen"></i> HP & Charger</div>
        <div class="gear-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-socks"></i> Sandal</div>
        <div class="gear-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-money-bill-wave"></i> Duit Cash</div>
        <div class="gear-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-bag-shopping"></i> Kantong Plastik (baju basah)</div>
      </div>

      <h4 style="color:var(--text-dim); margin-top:20px; font-size:0.95rem;">Optional Gear:</h4>
      <div class="gear-grid">
        <div class="gear-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-umbrella"></i> Jas Hujan</div>
        <div class="gear-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-battery-full"></i> Power Bank</div>
        <div class="gear-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-spray-can"></i> Lotion Nyamuk</div>
        <div class="gear-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-sun"></i> Sunscreen</div>
        <div class="gear-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-hat-cowboy"></i> Topi</div>
        <div class="gear-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-band-aid"></i> Plester / Obat Luka</div>
        <div class="gear-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-mattress-pillow"></i> Handuk Kecil</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Syarat & Ketentuan (T&C) -->
    <div class="card">
      <h3><i class="fa-solid fa-clipboard-check"></i> Syarat & Ketentuan (T&C)</h3>
      <ul class="tc-list">
        <li>Peserta wajib mengikuti seluruh rangkaian kegiatan sesuai jadwal dan arahan panitia[cite: 3].</li>
        <li>Peserta wajib membawa seluruh <strong>Mandatory Gear</strong>[cite: 3, 4].</li>
        <li>Untuk kegiatan outdoor, gunakan pakaian dan alas kaki yang sesuai[cite: 3].</li>
        <li>Jaga keamanan, kebersihan, kenyamanan, dan kerja sama selama acara[cite: 3].</li>
        <li>Peserta bertanggung jawab penuh atas barang pribadi[cite: 3].</li>
        <li>Peserta yang membawa anak wajib konfirmasi ke panitia terlebih dahulu (biaya tambahan anak menjadi tanggung jawab peserta & anak wajib dalam pengawasan orang tua)[cite: 3].</li>
        <li>Pembayaran yang telah dilakukan tidak dapat dikembalikan[cite: 3].</li>
        <li>Bukti pembayaran wajib dikirimkan kepada PIC/panitia sebagai konfirmasi keikutsertaan[cite: 3].</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

  </div>

  <footer>
    <p>LET'S LEVEL UP TOGETHER![cite: 2]</p>
    <p style="font-size:0.8rem; margin-top:5px; color:#6B7280;">SCM Gathering 2026 • One team. One adventure. More memories.[cite: 2, 3]</p>
  </footer>

  <script>
    function copyRekening(norek) {
      navigator.clipboard.writeText(norek);
      alert("Nomor rekening berhasil disalin: " + norek);
    }

    function switchDay(day) {
      const day1 = document.getElementById('day1');
      const day2 = document.getElementById('day2');
      const btns = document.querySelectorAll('.tab-btn');

      if (day === 1) {
        day1.style.display = 'flex';
        day2.style.display = 'none';
        btns[0].classList.add('active');
        btns[1].classList.remove('active');
      } else {
        day1.style.display = 'none';
        day2.style.display = 'flex';
        btns[1].classList.add('active');
        btns[0].classList.remove('active');
      }
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
